Z||000012||RRobinson||03-22-2001||11:13 AM||||Kelvin,<BR>Whoa, I have the almost EXACT SAME CARS.<P>My 88 GT is red also, but with plain roof, grey cloth, air, cruise, pm, pw, wing, black wheels, and sub. Also, it's an auto. <P>My new 87 SE looks EXACTLY like yours. It has a V6, 5-speed getrag, sunroof, and wing. That's about it for options. I even put on some grey 86-87 GT wheels like that. I like the grey wheels on the notchback coupe, they look better than I thought they would. I am currently refinishing some hi-tech wheels that I will put on with some white-letter tires for the OEM look.<P>I will try to post some pictures someday.<P>Ryan   <BR>||||reg||10
